        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                "word": "prête-nom",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "90cb7806-ff76-43f2-95b2-c5c2854787eb",
                        "entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "prête-noms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c3e753b-380e-3c93-9efd-5afe218637ce",
                        "entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui, celle qui prête son nom dans quelque acte où le véritable contractant ne veut point paraître."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5d31ef7-e0e5-43e1-bd48-26b49dc34e04",
                                "sense_id": "0c3e753b-380e-3c93-9efd-5afe218637ce",
                                "text": "— Baron, j’ai besoin de soixante-dix mille francs, et je vous les demande. Vous prendrez un prête-nom à qui je déléguerai pour trois ans la quotité engageable de mes appointements, elle monte à vingt-cinq mille francs par an, c’est soixante-quinze mille francs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6225e45-21f5-4b0b-8745-15d34f8d9d88",
                                "sense_id": "0c3e753b-380e-3c93-9efd-5afe218637ce",
                                "text": "Quand il posséda la maison, il eut l’habileté, en un mois, de la faire revendre deux fois à des prête-noms, en grossissant chaque fois le prix d’achat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f7f199d-d58a-4a57-bce6-935baec4de69",
                                "sense_id": "0c3e753b-380e-3c93-9efd-5afe218637ce",
                                "text": "Traditionnellement, les organisations criminelles sont très présentes sur ce secteur, contrôlant soit des firmes par l’intermédiaire de prête-noms ou leur prélèvent des commissions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "591ca9f2-217d-40b4-a49b-a916a36e68ee",
                                "sense_id": "0c3e753b-380e-3c93-9efd-5afe218637ce",
                                "text": "Le scandale de l’agence K… prend des proportions inouïes. Ripoil, prête-nom de Fauconnier, banquier milliardaire, a glané des millions."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "322dfe7d-73c2-3adc-9a0b-2aad75e960ec",
                        "entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne agissant pour le compte d’un autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3424402a-4fd0-46b4-9ca1-c49933e98916",
                                "sense_id": "322dfe7d-73c2-3adc-9a0b-2aad75e960ec",
                                "text": "Ce fut donc le clergé qui, à Plassans, mena la réaction. La noblesse devint son prête-nom, rien de plus ; il se cacha derrière elle, il la gourmanda, la dirigea, parvint même à lui rendre une vie factice."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ec4d176-f1b2-4859-a945-bc213d97a6c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Strohmann",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Strohmann",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d4a7261-3c59-3f0e-8a73-9f0aa1963770",
                                        "entry_id": "d1cd6556-9837-303a-9410-3e1c7176089b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "menschliche Figur aus Stroh"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caf5a66d-52f5-4466-ae23-1bc47b44a902",
                                                "sense_id": "3d4a7261-3c59-3f0e-8a73-9f0aa1963770",
                                                "text": "Oben auf dem Dachboden liegt ein alter Strohmann."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bf59dc8-d385-3222-99e3-52142abd5b7b",
                                        "entry_id": "d1cd6556-9837-303a-9410-3e1c7176089b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der im Auftrag für jemand anderen, der sich (noch?) nicht zu erkennen geben will, handelt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f026716d-8091-4d42-b0a7-942c54a27c65",
                                                "sense_id": "9bf59dc8-d385-3222-99e3-52142abd5b7b",
                                                "text": "„An einem verregneten Sonntagnachmittag im Frühling hat Oliver die Idee, über einen Strohmann anzufragen, ob der momentane Besitzer an einen Verkauf denkt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63d14467-addc-4ed5-a6dd-d8e84bf272c1",
                                                "sense_id": "9bf59dc8-d385-3222-99e3-52142abd5b7b",
                                                "text": "„Danach war ein Schweizer Staatsbürger als Strohmann beauftragt worden, einige der in Deutschland wertlosen, in der übrigen Welt um so wertvolleren Gemälde der sogenannten »entarteten Kunst« zu kaufen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95cd72b6-f808-473f-abe3-c5397841830d",
                                                "sense_id": "9bf59dc8-d385-3222-99e3-52142abd5b7b",
                                                "text": "„Er kümmert sich um unseren Strohmann in Karatschi, von dem wir den richtigen Namen gar nicht kennen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcaa37d7-9af9-45d7-8020-16979b27f5c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "front person",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ac2ea24-2f83-42fe-bec9-4b54722affe6",
                        "source_entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "figurehead",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "figurehead",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e207f1e0-a99e-3d4c-b4a4-90e9ce5b075e",
                                        "entry_id": "48c6ff78-3c7d-3707-b8ba-3faa39d0c869",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A carved figure on the prow of a sailing ship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72800681-e128-39f0-b6da-8e203d607c77",
                                        "entry_id": "48c6ff78-3c7d-3707-b8ba-3faa39d0c869",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone in a nominal position of leadership who has little to no actual power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f27d9ef-a9f8-45f0-8683-fc6b33dd9d2f",
                                                "sense_id": "72800681-e128-39f0-b6da-8e203d607c77",
                                                "text": "Evidently he did not mean to be a mere figurehead, but to carry on the old tradition of Wilsthorpe's; and that was considered to be a good thing in itself and an augury for future prosperity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d37432da-8daa-4496-8643-7db23139b423",
                                                "sense_id": "72800681-e128-39f0-b6da-8e203d607c77",
                                                "text": "Instead she played, largely impeccably, the part of a modern constitutional monarch, a symbolic figurehead with a right to be consulted and to advise and warn political leaders privately and to show herself publicly as a focus of national life, celebration and commemoration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb9e707b-f047-4585-903a-8ec0d943d83e",
                                                "sense_id": "72800681-e128-39f0-b6da-8e203d607c77",
                                                "text": "Supporters of Wagenknecht, a controversial but prominent figurehead, are already hatching plans for a breakaway party to compete in the 2024 European elections, the German newspaper Taz reported this week."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba44fb2a-a2e2-3fa0-a6d7-5ab563e8e211",
                                        "entry_id": "48c6ff78-3c7d-3707-b8ba-3faa39d0c869",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's face."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa0a748f-587d-4680-8b00-e75ddf62b3ee",
                                                "sense_id": "ba44fb2a-a2e2-3fa0-a6d7-5ab563e8e211",
                                                "text": "HATCHET. Bring up, I say, or I'll spoil your figurehead. [Lifting his cudgel]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1894012c-711c-475b-8151-78f589fdedfa",
                        "source_entry_id": "72cf487b-1d97-3ce0-b73e-0e26f04324f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "cover name",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cover name",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a9f481b-10e9-3f2f-beb1-34cecf8cc7a6",
                                        "entry_id": "f1984536-05cd-3945-8486-879f15ce8d19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A name used to clandestinely identify somebody or something for confidentiality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d31075e-fac6-421b-88df-68c842f00bcd",
                                                "sense_id": "0a9f481b-10e9-3f2f-beb1-34cecf8cc7a6",
                                                "text": "By the time that he landed in New York early in June, 1915, Sir Edgar Speyer had good cause to be well aware that the Government was strongly opposed to any communication, direct or indirect, with enemy country and to all attempts to evade the censorship of letters and cables, whether by the use of code words or cover names;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26bb88f2-c895-4df4-b628-b2aef0650864",
                                                "sense_id": "0a9f481b-10e9-3f2f-beb1-34cecf8cc7a6",
                                                "text": "1941, Richard Krebs (as Jan Valtin), Out of the Night, New York: Alliance Book Corporation, Chapter 31, p. 493,\nThe map of Germany was in my head—its cities, rivers, railroad schedules. I memorized a long string of names and cover names […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "964883a6-2a12-4c13-9f4c-920e46418c54",
                                                "sense_id": "0a9f481b-10e9-3f2f-beb1-34cecf8cc7a6",
                                                "text": "[…] his headquarters were located, under a cover name, at the air terminal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fdf83fe-9839-488e-bdfe-51e1a15b25b7",
                                                "sense_id": "0a9f481b-10e9-3f2f-beb1-34cecf8cc7a6",
                                                "text": "‘That’s a new one for us, isn’t it, Toby? A spy using his own name as a covername? I mean why bother any more? You’re Toby, so we’ll keep it a secret and call you Toby instead. Great.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9522c07b-0cec-4502-92bf-5de591cac7c2",
